    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm looking at the telemetry from the local sensor loop and the signal just dropped for a full 45 seconds near the asset's position. That doesn't match \"heightened activity\" — that looks like a localized jam or a breach. Is there anything not making it into your report? I need a full situational assessment of the asset's safety right now.",
